------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream origin
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ForgeKeep began as a fork of IronForge:

    https://github.com/lengyuqu/ironforge

At the time of forking, the upstream IronForge README identified the project
as MIT licensed in two places: an "MIT" license badge and a plain-text
"License: MIT" statement in the body of the README. However, the upstream
repository did not ship a LICENSE, NOTICE, or COPYING file containing the full
MIT License text and an explicit copyright notice, and GitHub reported no
detected license for it.

This NOTICE is provided in good faith to credit the upstream project and to
record the fork's provenance accurately. The upstream author's stated intent
was to release the project under the MIT License; the omission was the license
file itself, not the license grant. Anyone reusing code that originates from
upstream IronForge (rather than ForgeKeep's own changes) should preserve this
attribution and, before wider distribution, confirm the applicable terms with
the upstream author directly.
